title: Veeam: Protection group
agents: special
catalog: os/storage
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors an agent protection group of a Veeam Backup & Replication
 server, collected via the Veeam special agent. It reports the protection
 group type, the number of configured computers (for group types that list
 them), the description and whether the group is disabled. Reading
 protection groups requires the Veeam Backup Administrator, Restore Operator
 or Tape Operator role.

 This check is {WARN} by default if the protection group is disabled; the
 state is configurable, since a deliberately disabled protection group is
 normal in some estates. Otherwise it is {OK}.

discovery:
 One service is created for each agent protection group reported by the API.

item:
 The name of the protection group.
